// The app's version, the one place it is set. It is the base configuration of the project, so every target inherits it.
// release-please rewrites the line between the markers in each Release PR (release-please-config.json, extra-files);
// tools/release.sh refuses to build a tag whose version differs from the built app's.
// x-release-please-start-version
MARKETING_VERSION = 2.1.0
// x-release-please-end

// The app's name on the Mac, per flavour. App Review refuses "Mac" in an App Store app's name (guideline 5.2.5; mac4DSTEM
// 5.2.0 rejected 16 Nov 2026), so the store build (MACEM_STORE_BUILD=YES) is "Electron Microscopy Studio": the .app, its
// executable and CFBundleDisplayName (Finder, About). The menu bar takes CFBundleName, which Apple keeps short: "Microscopy
// Studio" (Info.plist). The website download keeps "macEM" for both. The module stays macTEM (PRODUCT_MODULE_NAME) and the
// bundle identifier is unchanged. AppName.display (TEMCore) carries the name into the app's sentences.
MACEM_APP_NAME_NO = macEM
MACEM_APP_NAME_YES = Electron Microscopy Studio
MACEM_MENU_NAME_NO = macEM
MACEM_MENU_NAME_YES = Microscopy Studio
MACEM_MENU_NAME = $(MACEM_MENU_NAME_$(MACEM_STORE_BUILD))
